="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">来！</span></p><p begin="1:11.783" end="1:16.203" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.783" end="1:12.397">Who</span> <span begin="1:12.397" end="1:12.774">sur</span><span begin="1:12.774" end="1:13.816">vived?</span> <span begin="1:14.274" end="1:14.751">Some</span><span begin="1:14.751" end="1:15.017">bo</span><span begin="1:15.017" end="1:15.421">dy</span> <span begin="1:15.421" end="1:16.203">new?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">还有谁存活了下来？有人吗？</span></p><p begin="1:17.108" end="1:20.396" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.108" end="1:17.463">A</span><span begin="1:17.463" end="1:17.816">ny</span><span begin="1:17.816" end="1:18.191">one</span> <span begin="1:18.191" end="1:18.875">else</span> <span begin="1:19.217" end="1:19.592">but</span> <span begin="1:19.592" end="1:20.396">you?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">除你之外 还有别人吗？</span></p><p begin="1:21.749" end="1:27.665" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.749" end="1:22.230">On</span> <span begin="1:22.230" end="1:22.611">a</span> <span begin="1:22.611" end="1:23.163">lone</span><span begin="1:23.163" end="1:23.487">ly</span> <span begin="1:23.487" end="1:24.227">night</span> <span begin="1:24.980" end="1:25.160">was</span> <span begin="1:25.160" end="1:25.325">a</span> <span begin="1:25.325" end="1:25.684">blin</span><span begin="1:25.684" end="1:26.364">ding</span> <span begin="1:26.364" end="1:27.665">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">孤夜 盲灯</span></p><p begin="1:28.330" end="1:32.074" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.330" end="1:28.764">A</span> <span begin="1:28.764" end="1:29.035">hun</span><span begin="1:29.035" end="1:29.358">dred</span> <span begin="1:29.358" end="1:29.693">lea</span><span begin="1:29.693" end="1:30.043">ders</span> <span begin="1:30.043" end="1:30.306">would</span> <span begin="1:30.306" end="1:30.792">be</span> <span begin="1:30.792" end="1:31.361">borne</span> <span begin="1:31.361" end="1:31.606">of</span> <span begin="1:31.606" end="1:32.074">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">成千上万的精灵 会为你而生 照你前路</span></p><p begin="1:32.439" end="1:37.867" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.439" end="1:32.667">And</span> <span begin="1:32.667" end="1:32.953">though</span> <span begin="1:32.953" end="1:33.343">I</span> <span begin="1:33.343" end="1:33.859">know,</span> <span begin="1:35.089" end="1:35.404">since</span> <span begin="1:35.404" end="1:35.859">you&apos;ve</span> <span begin="1:35.859" end="1:36.087">a</span><span begin="1:36.087" end="1:36.469">wa</span><span begin="1:36.469" end="1:36.789">kened</span> <span begin="1:36.789" end="1:37.108">her</span> <span begin="1:37.108" end="1:37.321">a</span><span begin="1:37.321" end="1:37.867">gain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尽管我明白 自从你再度唤醒她后</span></p><p begin="1:38.105" end="1:43.251" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.105" end="1:38.468">She</span> <span begin="1:38.468" end="1:38.652">de</span><span begin="1:38.652" end="1:39.486">pends</span> <span begin="1:39.486" end="1:40.005">on</span> <span begin="1:40.005" end="1:40.584">you,</span> <span begin="1:40.853" end="1:41.178">she</span> <span begin="1:41.178" end="1:41.393">de</span><span begin="1:41.393" end="1:42.276">pends</span> <span begin="1:42.276" end="1:42.761">on</span> <span begin="1:42.761" end="1:43.251">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她唯独的依靠只有你 只有你</span></p><p begin="1:43.251" end="1:48.662" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.251" end="1:43.536">She&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:43.536" end="1:44.031">go</span> <span begin="1:44.031" end="1:44.178">a</span><span begin="1:44.178" end="1:44.611">lone,</span> <span begin="1:45.884" end="1:46.185">and</span> <span begin="1:46.185" end="1:46.652">ne</span><span begin="1:46.652" end="1:46.977">ver</span> <span begin="1:46.977