13" end="3:00.191">know</span> <span begin="3:00.191" end="3:00.519">much</span> <span begin="3:00.519" end="3:00.691">a</span><span begin="3:00.691" end="3:01.014">bout</span> <span begin="3:01.014" end="3:01.370">your</span> <span begin="3:01.370" end="3:01.879">life</span> <span begin="3:01.879" end="3:02.036">be</span><span begin="3:02.036" end="3:02.401">yond</span> <span begin="3:02.401" end="3:02.771">these</span> <span begin="3:02.771" end="3:03.801">walls</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不太了解你无所羁绊的生活</span></p><p begin="3:05.142" end="3:10.053" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:05.142" end="3:05.330">The</span> <span begin="3:05.330" end="3:05.873">flee</span><span begin="3:05.873" end="3:06.156">ting</span> <span begin="3:06.156" end="3:06.442">sense</span> <span begin="3:06.442" end="3:06.870">of</span> <span begin="3:06.870" end="3:07.307">love</span> <span begin="3:07.307" end="3:07.417">wi</span><span begin="3:07.417" end="3:07.761">thin</span> <span begin="3:07.761" end="3:08.202">these</span> <span begin="3:08.202" end="3:08.739">God</span> <span begin="3:08.739" end="3:08.896">for</span> <span begin="3:08.896" end="3:09.183">sa</span><span begin="3:09.183" end="3:09.555">ken</span> <span begin="3:09.555" end="3:10.053">halls</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">与在这些上帝遗弃的殿堂中 那转瞬即逝的爱意</span></p><p begin="3:10.071" end="3:14.323" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:10.071" end="3:10.356">And</span> <span begin="3:10.356" end="3:10.545">you</span> <span begin="3:10.545" end="3:10.899">can</span> <span begin="3:10.899" end="3:11.276">hear</span> <span begin="3:11.276" end="3:11.424">it</span> <span begin="3:11.424" end="3:11.849">in</span> <span begin="3:11.849" end="3:12.264">his</span> <span begin="3:12.264" end="3:12.768">voice,</span> <span begin="3:12.768" end="3:12.931">in</span> <span begin="3:12.931" end="3:13.231">e</span><span begin="3:13.231" end="3:13.564">very</span> <span begin="3:13.564" end="3:14.323">call</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在每次与他对话的声音中 你会明白</span></p><p begin="3:16.032" end="3:21.158" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:16.032" end="3:16.283">This</span> <span begin="3:16.283" end="3:16.631">girl</span> <span begin="3:16.631" end="3:16.981">who&apos;s</span> <span begin="3:16.981" end="3:17.295">slept</span> <span begin="3:17.295" end="3:17.646">a</span> <span begin="3:17.646" end="3:17.967">hun</span><span begin="3:17.967" end="3:18.281">dred</span> <span begin="3:18.281" end="3:18.666">years</span> <span begin="3:18.666" end="3:19.002">has</span> <span begin="3:19.002" end="3:19.291">some</span><span begin="3:19.291" end="3:19.632">thing</span> <span begin="3:19.632" end="3:20.014">af</span><span begin="3:20.014" end="3:20.325">ter</span> <span begin="3:20.325" end="3:21.158">all</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这沉睡百年的女孩 其实并非一无是处</span></p><p begin="3:43.019" end="3:49.285" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:43.019" end="3:43.107">And</span> <span begin="3:43.107" end="3:43.462">though</span> <span begin="3:43.462" end="3:43.862">I</span> <span begin="3:43.862" end="3:44.652">know,</span> <span begin="3:46.129" end="3:46.492">since</span> <span begin="3:46.492" end="3:46.907">you&apos;ve</span> <span begin="3:46.907" end="3:47.207">a</span><span begin="3:47.207" end="3:47.694">wa</span><span begin="3:47.694" end="3:48.087">kened</span> <span begin="3:48.087" end="3:48.447">her</span> <span begin="3:48.447" end="3:48.642">a</span><span begin="3:48.642" end="3:49.285">gain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尽管我明白 自从你再度唤醒她后</span></p><p begin="3:49.664" end="3:55.347" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:49.664" end="3:50.029">She</span> <span begin="3:50.029" end="3:50.287">de</span><span begin="3:50.287" end="3:51.377">pends</span> <span begin="3:51.377" end="3:51.909">on</span> <span begin="3:51.909" end="3:52.317">you,</span> <